      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwamakumi abiri n'olulala, olw'omwezi ogwomusanvu mu mwaka gwene ogwo, Musengwa Katonda kabiri yaayogera ng'abita mu mulanzi Haggai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba Haggai aje ye Zerubbabeli mutabane wa Shealutieli era omufuzi wa Buyudaaya, ni Yoshua mutabane wa Yehozadaki era omukulu wa bakabona, n'abantu boonaboona abaira okuva mu bunhage, abakobe ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezer 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Naani ku imwe abakaasigairegho, eyabona eisinzizo lino mu kitiisa kyalyo ekyasooka? Mperaano libabonekera litya? Liteekwa kuba nga lyaweeramu irala ekitiisa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye iwe Zerubbabeli, n'iwe Yoshua mutabane wa Yehozadaki era omukulu wa bakabona, n'imwe abantu mwenamwena abali mu nsi eno, mutawaamu maani naire. Mukole bukole mulimo, kuba ndi ghalala n'imwe, nze Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.45+EXO.29.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 29:45-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga muli kuva mu nsi Misiri, nabasuubiza okubanga aghalala n'imwe buliidho. Kale ni mulobe kutya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
